New rule that requires curly braces (`{}`) in if statements https://eslint.org/docs/latest/rules/curly

❌ Failing examples:
```ts
if (foo) foo++;

while (bar)
    baz();

if (foo) {
    baz();
} else qux();
```

✅ Passing examples:
```ts
if (foo) {
    foo++;
}

while (bar) {
    baz();
}

if (foo) {
    baz();
} else {
    qux();
}
```

